    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "t_steps_body",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 108,
      "width": 368,
      "height": 128,
      "text": "1. State tree inclusion  rebuild root from leaves + path\n2. State commitment  H(stateRoot, stateSalt)\n   → must equal processMessages.newStateCommitment\n3. Vote root match  H(votes[i]) == stateLeaf[i].voteRoot\n4. Current tally check  batchNum==0 → assert(current==0)\n5. Quadratic tally  tallyVote(v) = v × (v + 10^24)\n6. New tally commitment  H(H(newResults), salt)\n7. inputHash  aggregates all public fields",
      "originalText": "1. State tree inclusion  rebuild root from leaves + path\n2. State commitment  H(stateRoot, stateSalt)\n   → must equal processMessages.newStateCommitment\n3. Vote root match  H(votes[i]) == stateLeaf[i].voteRoot\n4. Current tally check  batchNum==0 → assert(current==0)\n5. Quadratic tally  tallyVote(v) = v × (v + 10^24)\n6. New tally commitment  H(H(newResults), salt)\n7. inputHash  aggregates all public fields",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#333333",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
